<title>UK: Council of Europe sets $250 mln one-year bond.</title>
<headline>Council of Europe sets $250 mln one-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Nomura.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COUNCIL OF EUROPE</p>
<p> AMT    $250 MLN	COUPON     5.20	MATURITY    17.JUN.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    17.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.50	LISTING    NONE	PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AA1/AAA   DENOMS (K) FIVE	SALE LIMS US/UK/FR/JP</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   MGT/UND    15 BP     SELL CONC   35 BP</p>
<p> NOTES	BORROWERS FULL NAME IS COUNCIL OF EUROPE SOCIAL</p>
<p>		DEVELOPMENT FUND</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
